[h2]Build 0.9.132[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]The industrial repair center now works like a [b]skill 8[/b] crafter at 100% overclock (was 10), and overclocking past 100% no longer lowers its skill: up to 200% it stays at 8, costing only power and heat. Slowing it down still raises it, up to skill 20 at 10%.
[*]Core upgrades add to that: standard subcore 12, high subcore 16, persona core 20 at normal speed.
[/list]
